{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026q3ck1tOHiL1794823104.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新界東豪宅白石角第二分行高級分區營業經理徐家倫表示，大埔白石角區交投持續向好，白石角Silicon Hill最新錄5座高層A5室，單位實用面積217平方呎，開放式間隔，日前議價後以390萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約17,972元。<br/>中原徐家倫表示，新租客為投資者，見屋苑環境舒適，價錢合理，即購入單位投資收租，單位市值月租約13000元，買家料可享約4厘租金回報。據了解，業主於2022年以394萬元購入單位，持貨約4年，是次轉手賬面上蝕4萬元或1%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.620060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.958569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:18.335121+00:00","content_hash":"e742e75f4787abf02138a204294187a86e6184f69a8b828e97fb1f66e91e7b61","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.620060+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}